{
  "id": "imitation-game",
  "term": "imitation game",
  "definition": "In this context, an imitation game is a social interaction used to observe how aware a child is of being copied and how they respond to that imitation. It serves as a way of assessing early responsiveness to a social partner in relation to later development of self-concept.",
